To add a few more detail to the price-id/zap/kill technique for expensives  
wands in shops, I would say :
1/ Be sure to be as far from the shopkeeper as possible before starting  
and him as close to a wall as possible. This gives the ray 2 chances to  
kill him and hopefully you'll be to far to be hit by the reflection (of  
course, with MR, this is no more a problem).
2/ If wishing, always start wishing for the scrolls of charging (in case  
the wand is 0:1) if you can't have a blessed one soon.
3/ If wishing, empty you wand before zapping the wand of death from second  
wish and killing the shopkeeper. Killing peacful hampers luck. Negative  
luck hampers wish.

